segments.en:
'He shall godly and piously give to godly men a set of the
priestly instruments of which the priests make use, to redeem his
own soul, namely: The Astra; the meat-vessel; the Paitidana;
the Khrafstraghna; the Sraosho-charana; the cup for the
Myazda; the cups for mixing and dividing;
the regular mortar; the Haoma cups; and the Baresma.
